{"seq":3,"slug":"3d-vision","title":"三维视觉与点云处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/detection/3d-vision","wordCount":1293,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"三维视觉与点云处理\">三维视觉与点云处理</h1><p>当感知需要从&quot;平面像素&quot;走向&quot;空间理解&quot;时，三维视觉成为必须。自动驾驶的 LiDAR 点云、机器人的深度相机、AR 的空间建图——这些场景都要求系统理解物体的三维位置、形状和运动。本文聚焦点云处理的核心算法与工程实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三维视觉的数据源和表示形式多样，每种有不同的工程约束：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[3D 数据源] --&gt; B[LiDAR 点云]&#10;    A --&gt; C[深度相机 RGB-D]&#10;    A --&gt; D[多视角重建 SfM/MVS]&#10;    A --&gt; E[合成数据 NeRF/3DGS]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; F[稀疏、远距离、大场景]&#10;    C --&gt; G[稠密、室内、有限距离]&#10;    D --&gt; H[后处理生成、离线]&#10;    E --&gt; I[可微渲染、高保真]&#10;&#10;    F --&gt; J[点云处理网络]&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[3D 检测/分割/跟踪]\">graph TD\n    A[3D 数据源] --&gt; B[LiDAR 点云]\n    A --&gt; C[深度相机 RGB-D]\n    A --&gt; D[多视角重建 SfM/MVS]\n    A --&gt; E[合成数据 NeRF/3DGS]\n\n    B --&gt; F[稀疏、远距离、大场景]\n    C --&gt; G[稠密、室内、有限距离]\n    D --&gt; H[后处理生成、离线]\n    E --&gt; I[可微渲染、高保真]\n\n    F --&gt; J[点云处理网络]\n    G --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[3D 检测/分割/跟踪]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示形式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>典型传感器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点云</td>\n<td>精确 3D 坐标、无量化损失</td>\n<td>稀疏、无序、密度不均</td>\n<td>LiDAR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体素网格</td>\n<td>规则结构、可用 3D 卷积</td>\n<td>高分辨率内存爆炸</td>\n<td>LiDAR → 体素化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BEV (鸟瞰图)</td>\n<td>适合驾驶场景、2D卷积高效</td>\n<td>高度信息损失</td>\n<td>LiDAR/Camera → BEV 投影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三平面/隐式</td>\n<td>连续表示、任意分辨率</td>\n<td>训练复杂、推理慢</td>\n<td>NeRF / 3D Gaussian Splatting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多视角图像</td>\n<td>低成本传感器</td>\n<td>需要深度估计/对应</td>\n<td>相机阵列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"pointnet-系列-直接处理无序点集\">PointNet 系列：直接处理无序点集</h2><p>PointNet（2017）的核心洞见：点云是<strong>无序集合</strong>，网络必须对点的排列顺序具有不变性（permutation invariance）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></munder><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\{x_1, ..., x_n\\}) = \\gamma(\\max_{i=1,...,n} h(x_i))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6138em;vertical-align:-0.8638em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8638em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是逐点 MLP（共享参数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 是对称聚合函数保证置换不变性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 是下游 MLP。</p>\n<p><strong>PointNet++ 的层级化改进：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>用最远点采样（FPS）选择 keypoint</li>\n<li>对每个 keypoint 的邻域用 PointNet 提取局部特征</li>\n<li>多尺度分组（MSG）：不同半径的球查询捕获不同尺度</li>\n<li>层级化叠加：构建类似 CNN 的多层级特征提取</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"体素化方法-voxelnet-与稀疏卷积\">体素化方法：VoxelNet 与稀疏卷积</h2><p>对于大规模户外场景（自动驾驶），直接处理 10 万+ 点的 PointNet++ 太慢。体素化方法将连续点云离散化到 3D 网格，然后用 3D 卷积处理：</p>\n<p><strong>VoxelNet 流程：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>将点云空间划分为固定大小的体素（如 0.1m x 0.1m x 0.2m）</li>\n<li>每个体素内的点用小型 PointNet 聚合为单一特征向量</li>\n<li>稀疏 3D 卷积处理非空体素</li>\n<li>BEV 压缩 + 2D 检测头输出 3D bbox</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>稀疏卷积（Sparse Convolution）</strong>：大规模点云中 90%+ 体素为空，稀疏卷积只计算非空体素，用哈希表索引邻居。MinkowskiEngine / SpConv 是主流实现，推理速度比 Dense 3D Conv 快 10-100 倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bev-感知-自动驾驶的主流范式\">BEV 感知：自动驾驶的主流范式</h2><p>2022 年以来，BEV（Bird&#39;s Eye View）感知成为自动驾驶的主流范式。核心思路是将多传感器数据统一投影到鸟瞰视角下处理：</p>\n<p><strong>Camera-only BEV（BEVFormer / BEVDet）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>多个环视相机的 2D 特征 → Lift-Splat-Shoot 或 Cross-Attention 投影到 BEV</li>\n<li>纯视觉方案成本低，但深度估计误差较大</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>LiDAR-Camera 融合 BEV（BEVFusion）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>LiDAR 点云体素化后投影到 BEV</li>\n<li>Camera 特征也投影到 BEV</li>\n<li>在 BEV 空间做特征级融合</li>\n<li>nuScenes 检测 mAP 达到 72.9%（2024 SOTA）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>BEV</mtext><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>Conv</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Cat</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>BEV</mtext><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>BEV</mtext><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BEV}_{fused} = \\text{Conv}(\\text{Cat}(\\text{BEV}_{lidar}, \\text{BEV}_{camera}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BEV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Conv</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cat</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BEV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BEV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"3d-gaussian-splatting-新一代场景表示\">3D Gaussian Splatting：新一代场景表示</h2><p>3D Gaussian Splatting（3DGS, 2023）用数百万个 3D 高斯基元表示场景，支持实时（30+ FPS）的高保真新视角合成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 Gaussian 由位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>、协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span>、不透明度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 和球谐系数描述</li>\n<li>渲染通过&quot;投影到 2D + alpha blending&quot;实现，可微且高效</li>\n<li>工程价值：比 NeRF 快 100-1000 倍，适合实时应用（AR/VR、数字孪生）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三维视觉的核心挑战是数据稀疏性、无序性和大规模场景的计算效率</li>\n<li>PointNet/PointNet++ 建立了直接处理点集的理论基础</li>\n<li>稀疏卷积是大规模点云处理的工程标准</li>\n<li>BEV 范式统一了多传感器融合，成为自动驾驶感知的主流架构</li>\n<li>3DGS 以实时渲染速度开启了新一代场景表示</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工程选型决策\">工程选型决策</h2><p>在实际项目中选择三维视觉方案时，核心考量因素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动驾驶感知</td>\n<td>BEVFusion + 稀疏卷积</td>\n<td>多传感器融合、成熟工具链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>室内机器人导航</td>\n<td>PointNet++ / RGBD SLAM</td>\n<td>稠密深度、实时性要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工业测量/质检</td>\n<td>结构光 + 点云配准</td>\n<td>精度优先、环境可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AR 场景重建</td>\n<td>3D Gaussian Splatting</td>\n<td>实时渲染、消费级设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大规模城市建图</td>\n<td>LiDAR SLAM + NeRF 后处理</td>\n<td>大范围、高保真</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>实时性与精度的工程权衡</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>LiDAR 稀疏卷积在 Jetson Orin 上可达 20 FPS（nuScenes 10 类检测）</li>\n<li>BEV 融合方案需要 2xA100 才能实时处理 6 路环视相机 + LiDAR</li>\n<li>3DGS 渲染在 RTX 4090 上可达 100+ FPS（1080p），但训练需要数小时</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>数据标注挑战</strong>：3D 标注成本远高于 2D——一个 3D bbox 标注约 114 秒（vs 2D bbox 的 25 秒）。解决方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>4D 自动标注（利用序列信息自动追踪并标注）</li>\n<li>多模态预标注（2D 检测 → 3D 投影 → 人工修正）</li>\n<li>仿真数据（CARLA / Isaac Sim）生成合成标注</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇 <a href=\"sam-segmentation\">SAM 2 通用分割模型</a> 中的视频分割与 3D 体数据处理思路相通</li>\n<li>跨库参考：多模态 Transformer 如何处理非文本输入见 <a href=\"../../nlp-transformers/applications/multimodal-transformers\">多模态 Transformer</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"三维视觉与点云处理","id":"三维视觉与点云处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PointNet 系列：直接处理无序点集","id":"pointnet-系列-直接处理无序点集"},{"level":2,"text":"体素化方法：VoxelNet 与稀疏卷积","id":"体素化方法-voxelnet-与稀疏卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"BEV 感知：自动驾驶的主流范式","id":"bev-感知-自动驾驶的主流范式"},{"level":2,"text":"3D Gaussian Splatting：新一代场景表示","id":"3d-gaussian-splatting-新一代场景表示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"工程选型决策","id":"工程选型决策"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"SAM 2 通用分割模型与工程落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/detection/sam-segmentation"},"next":{"title":"扩散模型与 Stable Diffusion 3 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/generation/diffusion-models"}}